  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_037) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.706). This experiment tests whether a single modality (RNA-only) with the same scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile setting (which has shown strong performance in previous multimodal models) can match or exceed this performance. It isolates the impact of modality choice while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation consistent, addressing uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches are strictly necessary."
}

